  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACT: Arab Women&apos;s Rights and the Media, 2010-13 - Arab Women&apos;s rights and regional Media Monitoring</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ACT: Kvinnors r&#xe4;ttigheter &amp; media, 2010-13</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen st&#xf6;der uppr&#xe4;ttandet av och arbetet hos ett regionalt n&#xe4;tverk kring k&#xf6;nsstereotyper i regionens medier. De deltagande               organisatinerna kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra monitoring av medieinneh&#xe5;ll och  att anv&#xe4;nda resultaten f&#xf6;r att s&#xf6;ka skapa &#xf6;kad medvetenhet kring      dessa fr&#xe5;gor hos journalister, medie&#xe4;gare och redakt&#xf6;rer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contributions supports the establishment and activities of a      regional network dealing with gender stereotypes in the media of the  region. The participating organisations will monitor media content    and use the results to increase awareness of these issues among       journalists, editors, and media owners.</narrative>
  </description>
